# launcher-enchants: from the menu, load the saved game setup/launcher-enchants writes (on level 1
# at (36, 6), facing the locked door at (36, 8), with a crossbow "of Unsurpassed Damage" (effect
# 15), a bow "of Unsurpassed Accuracy" (effect 7), crossbow bolts and arrows in the pack). Put
# the crossbow in the weapon hand and shoot two bolts at the door; put it back, take the bow and
# shoot two arrows. With the fix each bolt's damage before the dice is 8 more (DoPlayerWeapon's
# (effect & 7) + 1) and each arrow's Missile-skill check is made at the skill plus 8; without it
# (the original: the same recording with its enhancements chunk naming skip-intro alone) the
# launchers add nothing. tools/launchercheck.py reads both from the missile probe
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
6500 move 250 92    # the crossbow, from the pack into the weapon hand
6800 mdown 250 92 right
7100 move 277 68
7400 move 304 44
7700 mup 304 44 right
8900 key f5    # fight mode: the weapon drawn
9700 move 140 90
10400 mdown 140 90 right    # drawn until the gem is ready, then released in the view: a bolt at the door
11900 mup 140 90 right
12600 mdown 140 90 right
14100 mup 140 90 right
15600 key f5    # fight mode left
16800 move 304 44    # the crossbow back into the pack
17100 mdown 304 44 right
17400 move 277 68
17700 move 250 92
18000 mup 250 92 right
19200 move 268 92    # the bow into the weapon hand
19500 mdown 268 92 right
19800 move 286 68
20100 move 304 44
20400 mup 304 44 right
21600 key f5    # fight mode: the weapon drawn
22400 move 140 90
23100 mdown 140 90 right    # two arrows at the door
24600 mup 140 90 right
25300 mdown 140 90 right
26800 mup 140 90 right
28300 key f5    # fight mode left
29800 move 160 100
